---
const paths = [
  {
    lead: "If it has runway left, we optimize it.",
    body: "We clean up the power feeding it, tune the controls, and pull the maximum savings out of the system you already own. You get the juice without the capital event.",
  },
  {
    lead: "When a unit or a fleet is near the end, we replace it.",
    body: "World-class equipment, sized and integrated for your actual building, not a like-for-like swap from whoever answers the emergency call. The replacement you were going to make anyway becomes a strategic upgrade instead of a crisis purchase.",
  },
];
---

<section class="section hvac" id="hvac" aria-labelledby="hvac-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hvac__head reveal">
      <h2 class="hvac__title" id="hvac-title">
        Your HVAC, two ways we get the savings.
      </h2>
      <p class="hvac__lede lede">
        HVAC is the largest electrical load in almost every hotel, which makes
        it the biggest lever and the biggest liability at once. How we handle
        it depends on where your equipment is in its life.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hvac__paths">
      {
        paths.map((p, i) => (
          <div class="hvac__path reveal" style={`--i: ${i}`}>
            <p class="hvac__lead">{p.lead}</p>
            <p class="hvac__body">{p.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class="hvac__close reveal" style="--i: 2">
      Either way, you are not buying our box, because we don't have one. We
      select and size what your building actually needs.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hvac {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hvac__head {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }
  .hvac__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .hvac__lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
  }

  .hvac__paths {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .hvac__path {
    padding-top: var(--space-m);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .hvac__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .hvac__body {
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .hvac__close {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 48ch;
  }
</style>
